[[Dante Vale]], [[Sophie Casterwill]], [[Cherit]], and [[Lok Lambert]] took a flight at Marco Polo Airport for [[Prague, Czech Republic]], in search of information on the [[Amulet of Will]]. [[Santiago]] was initially opposed to Sophie travelling abroad, but he allowed Dante to take her with him after he took a [[Raypulse]] that was intended for her at the [[Venice Huntik Library]]. {{source|The Casterwill Client}}

Sophie tried to buy plane tickets for [[Egypt]] at the airport, but her cards kept getting declined. She was later informed that [[The Organization]] had blocked all her funds. This led Sophie and Lok to take part-time jobs to try and pay for the tickets, but Dante bought them out of his own pocket for the sake of the mission. {{source|All Work and No Pay}}

